<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23994" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δελφί̄ν-ιον</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[φῐ]</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>temple of Apollo
				Delphinios,</i> esp. at Athens, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐπὶ
				Δελφινίῳ δικαστήριον</span> the law-court <i>there,</i>
			Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.78
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				57.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				12.18
			</span></i>, etc.: also at Chalcis, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Flam.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>larkspur, Delphinium Ajacis,</i> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				20.2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>dolphin-flower, Delphinium Consolida,</i> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> l.c.</div>
